  "pLoudTargetHint": "{lufs} LUFS, peaks at most {tp} dBTP",
  "pLoudTargetHelp": "LUFS is perceived loudness. Platforms turn down anything too loud, so it is best to hit their target: YouTube and Spotify −14, podcasts (Apple) −16, TV per EBU R128 −23. True Peak limits peaks so MP3/AAC compression does not distort.",
