  "pTwoPassLoudOff": "One pass: faster, but adjusts dynamically",
  "pTwoPassLoudHelp": "The first pass measures the whole file, the second applies one gain everywhere: dynamics are preserved and the result hits the target. One-pass mode adjusts on the fly and may pump. Default: two-pass.",
